So that much is now OK. The next problem occurs when I try to run
fit(plm,...). Following are the next steps of the script, along with
the error log. This script is almost identical to your script in the
"Human Exon Array Analysis" vignette, except I have included
setCdf(csN,cdfEnsb) per Elizabeth's suggestion above. (I get the same
