Those calls returns what you ask for, you get intensities for cell
index number nbrOfCells(cdf) and number length(units).  You need to
use 1:nbrOfCells(cdf).

FYI, the extractMatrix() for an AffymetrixCelSet is a different code
from ditto for a ChipEffectSet.  Bugs in one shouldn't affect the
other.

