>  You write that "they are downloaded to patches/aroma.affymetrix/<patch
>  date>/ in the current directory".
>  This means that I would need to create a "patches" directory for every
>  working directory, correct?

Actually that was what is was a few versions ago, but not any longer.
Now the patches are stored "centrally" in
~/.Rpatches/aroma.affymetrix/patches/aroma.affymetrix/<patch date>/.
I've updated the online 'Installation, Updates & Patches' page on
this.  Thanks for the note.

Cheers

Henrik

