Correction: ExonRmaPlm does *not* inherit from neither, but from
RmaPlm (-> ProbeLevelModel -> UnitModel -> Model -> Object).  You can
see this by typing print(ExonRmaPlm) and also
getSuperclasses(ExonRmaPlm).

What you probably meant was to say that the getChipEffectSet() for
ExonRmaPlm returns a ExonChipEffectSet, with
getSuperclasses(ExonChipEffectSet):

[1] "ChipEffectSet"      "ParameterCelSet"    "AffymetrixCelSet"
[4] "AffymetrixFileSet"  "GenericDataFileSet" "Object"

