A pretty easy fix.

ugnm<-getUnitGroupNamesFromUgcMap(cdf_1,ugcMap) # 2-column table w/
unit+group names
rownames(theta)<-paste(ugnm[,1],ugnm[,2],sep=".")

Cheers,
Mark

